    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Bacterial cultures were routinely grown on Mueller Hinton (MH) agar in anaerobic jars under microaerobic conditions (5% oxygen, 10% carbon dioxide, and 85% nitrogen) at 42°C."
